Package: libatk-bridge2.0-0
Version: @DEB_ATSPI2_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/at-spi2-core
Depends: libatspi2.0-0, libatk1.0-0, libglib2.0-0, dbus
Description: AT-SPI 2 toolkit bridge
 The ATK to AT-SPI bridge exposes ATK-based toolkits (GTK 3, GNOME Shell's St)
 on the AT-SPI accessibility bus.
